<title>SWEDEN: Norway's Statkraft rejigs Sydkraft stake.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statkraft rejigs Sydkraft stake.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's largest electricity producer Statkraft said on Friday it had sold 2.3 million A-series shares and bought 4.6 million C-series shares in Swedish power group Sydkraft.</p>
<p>After the transaction, Statkraft has 20.8 percent of votes in Sydkraft compared to 22.4 percent previously and its share of capital rises to 17.1 percent from 15.9 percent, Statkraft said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
